# <type>(<scope>): <what was done, imperative mood>    ≤ 72 characters
# Types: feat, fix, refactor, test, docs, build, ci, chore
# For an agent or skill, use its name as the scope:
#   feat(dev): clone repo into /workspace/repos
#
# Body is required, in English. One bullet per change: what changed and why.
# - ...
# - ...
#
# Refs: SPEC-NNN, #<issue>
#
# Enable the template: git config commit.template .gitmessage
